    "function_v0": {
      "doc": "Keeper sizing view (WP6): the backstop USDC pTokens `settle_backstop_debt(.., u128::MAX, ..)`\\nwould withdraw now, after the pooled-liquidity cap. 0 = nothing to withdraw: no backstop\\ndebt, the backstop's XLM pTokens cover it, or a controller shortfall (recapitalise first).\\nConservative: it ignores the liquidity a first repay from backstop XLM pTokens frees.",
      "name": "settle_max_ptokens",
      "inputs": [
