  {
    "function_v0": {
      "doc": "Permissionless: repay backstop-owned bad debt from backstop USDC pTokens (XLM: swap).\\nReturns debt repaid (raw debt units). Not gated by Impaired / the XLM freeze: it is the\\nrecovery path. Repays at most the backstop's own debt; never other positions' debt.\\n\\nWP6 (25 Nov):\\n- Self-sizing: the USDC withdrawal (health-checked by the live controller BEFORE the\\nrepay) is capped at what the pooled account's free liquidity allows (`account_liquidity`,\\n1 % haircut). Under a controller shortfall nothing can be withdrawn: `PooledShortfall`.\\nEach settle frees liquidity (repaid debt > CF-weighted collateral removed), so the keeper\\nrepeats it until `get_bs_debt_shares` is 0; `settle_max_ptokens` is the sizing view.\\n- XLM: the swap input comes from the pool's strict-receive quote for the debt + 0.05 %\\n(bounded by the oracle + max slippage), the output is still floored at the oracle less\\nmax slippage, and any XLM left after the repay is deposited as backstop XLM pTokens\\n(`BsXlmPt`, in Ledger(XLM)); the next XLM settle repays",
      "name": "settle_backstop_debt",
      "inputs": [
        {
          "doc": "",
          "name": "caller",
          "type_": "address"
        },
        {
          "doc": "",
          "name": "debt_asset",
          "type_": "address"
        },
        {
          "doc": "",
          "name": "max_ptokens",
          "type_": "u128"
        },
        {
          "doc": "",
          "name": "min_out",
          "type_": "u128"
        }
      ],
      "outputs": [
        "u128"
      ]
    }
  },
  {
    "function_v0": {
      "doc": "Permissionless: return the shares of an EXPIRED request (now > expires_at) to its backer,\\nso a stale request stops counting as pending (it is excluded from open headroom). Live\\nrequests are refused (BadParams). The backer's balance only ever grows here.",
      "name": "backstop_clear_expired",
      "inputs": [
        {
          "doc": "",
          "name": "caller",
          "type_": "address"
        },
        {
          "doc": "",
          "name": "backer",
          "type_": "address"
        }
      ],
      "outputs": []
    }
  },
